### List all categories
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/catalog/categories/
Content-Type: application/json

### List categories for a specific store
# Replace {{store_id}} with a real UUID after creating a store
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/catalog/categories/?store_id={{store_id}}
Content-Type: application/json
